s/QuantAgent-88h/20260504T124216Z-QuantAgent-88h-implementer/executor-prompt-claude-code.md`","-- Route plan: `/home/azureuser/repos/projects/QuantAgent/docs/envelopes/QuantAgent-88h/20260504T124216Z-QuantAgent-88h-implementer/route-plan-claude-code.json`","-- Commands log: `/home/azureuser/repos/projects/QuantAgent/docs/envelopes/QuantAgent-88h/20260504T124216Z-QuantAgent-88h-implementer/commands.log`","-- Quality gates log: `/home/azureuser/repos/projects/QuantAgent/docs/envelopes/QuantAgent-88h/20260504T124216Z-QuantAgent-88h-implementer/quality-gates.log`","-- Result JSON: `/home/azureuser/repos/projects/QuantAgent/docs/envelopes/QuantAgent-88h/20260504T124216Z-QuantAgent-88h-implementer/result.json`","-- Executor stdout: `not created`","+- `result.json` — updated with execution results","+- `run-report.md` — this file"," ","-## Risks / Open Questions","+## Risks"," ","-- none","+- yfinance requires internet at seed time; add `--no-market-data` flag in future if offline seeding needed.","+- TRUNCATE CASCADE also clears `scheduler_heartbeats` (FK to trades) — harmless but should be documented."," "," ## Next Step"," ","-- `execute_phase`","-- If dry-run looks good, rerun with `--execute` when ready.","+- Reviewer/human runs `python scripts/seed_dev.py --reset` against DEV DB to validate.","+- Merge PR to main once validated."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
