{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01QZincNtWTCxPuXxdez9XQn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XNKfWJBk5m1mLegLKEz9RZ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"bd comment QuantAgent-88h \"$(cat <<'EOF'\n### Skill: autodev-implementer\n- **Resultado:** SUCCESS\n- **Run-ID:** 20260504T124216Z-QuantAgent-88h-implementer\n- **Executor:** claude-code\n\n#### Qué hice\n- Creé `scripts/seed_dev.py` (721 líneas) en la rama `feature/QuantAgent-88h-create-seed-data-script-for-dev-and-qa-d`, commit `e80f3781`\n- Implementé los 7 escenarios transaccionales completos: winning trade, losing trade, open trade, neutral signal, cancelled order, backtest completo, backtest en progreso\n- 4 `strategy_configs` (RSI_Mean_Reversion, MACD_Momentum, Triple_Screen, Risk_Management_Default)\n- Descarga de market_data via yfinance: BTC-USD/1h, AAPL/1d, SPY/1d (>500 rows total)\n- Flags `--reset` (TRUNCATE CASCADE idempotente) y `--db-url` implementados\n- Resumen de registros por tabla al finalizar\n\n#### Evidencia\n- `ruff check --fix scripts/seed_dev.py` → All checks passed\n- `python -m compileall -q scripts/seed_dev.py` → limpio\n- `pytest` → 65 tests pass (1 error pre-existente por yfinance ausente en test venv)\n- Commit `e80f3781` en rama feature\n\n#### Quality gates\n- ruff: PASS (0 errores en archivo nuevo; 1 F841 pre-existente en test_universe_management.py)\n- compileall: PASS\n- pytest (subset): 65 passed, 1 pre-existing error (unrelated)\n\n#### Problemas encontrados\n- yfinance `interval=\"4h\"` no es universalmente soportado; el script usa `interval=\"1h\"` para BTC-USD con comentario explicativo\n- La FK circular `Signal.order_id ↔ Order.trigger_signal_id` requiere inserción en 3 pasos (signal→flush, order→flush, update signal) — manejado correctamente\n- `TRUNCATE ... CASCADE` también limpia `scheduler_heartbeats` (tiene FK a trades) — inofensivo pero documentado\n\n#### Next step recomendado\n- Ejecutar `python scripts/seed_dev.py --reset` contra DEV DB para validar aceptación\n- Revisar PR y mergear a main\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1","description":"Add final Beads comment to QuantAgent-88h"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":250,"cache_read_input_tokens":89443,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":250},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9ae4eb5f-cbea-4dfd-8ced-66c92dcf87ef","uuid":"039092a9-65bc-45bd-9071-018613eebea6"}
